{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46059","headline":"和毛学士舍人早春 · 贯休","name":"和毛学士舍人早春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陋巷冬将尽，东风细杂篮。\n解牵窗梦远，先是涧梅谙。\n茶癖金铛快，松香玉露含。\n书斋山帚撅，盘馔药花甘。\n雅得琴中妙，常挼脸似酣。\n雪消闻苦蛰，气候似宜蚕。\n密勿须清甲，朝归遶碧潭。\n丹心空拱北，新作继周南。\n竹杖无斑点，纱巾不着簪。\n大朝名益重，後进力皆覃。\n至理虽亡一，臣时亦说三。\n不知门下客，谁上晏婴骖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}